 },
 "integration": {
  "summary": "Use BV 1 for occupancy and the occupied setpoints (AV 23/AV 24, or Center SP AV 109) for the zone, then read zone temperature, airflow, demand and damper state. Check what each output is assigned to (MV 2-6) before mapping Out1-Out5.",
